  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing CSOs contribution to the advancement of the rights and living conditions of marginalized and war-affected communities in North Central and Eastern Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective of the proposed Action is To contribute to inclusive and sustainable socio-economic development of marginalized and war-affected communities in North Central and Eastern Sri Lanka.The Specific objective is Strengthened Cooperatives promoting social inclusion and better services to marginalized women and men members representing their rights and entitlements.</narrative>
  </description>
